{"dog":{"age_group":"young","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Large mixed breed","breed_primary":"Large Mixed Breed Cross","description_text":"What my friends at ACC say about me:\n\nI can go home today!\n\nI would appreciate slow introductions to new people and places to help me feel safe.\n\nI will need daily physical activity to keep me healthy and happy!\n\nA volunteer writes: Yes, this is one big guy! However, do not be fooled by his size. Hunter is as lovely and charming as can be. He comes out of his kennel carefully, ready for a good walk. And it's a great walk. Hunter strides along at a fairly good pace, but he is very respectful of his companion's needs. Although Hunter is not crazy about other dogs, he more or less minds his own business. While taking a break on a bench, Hunter comes over regularly for attention and pets. He is rather sweet and gentle. Come meet Hunter at Manhattan ACC.","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=3%2C16&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=5&searchType=4&animalid=206963","id":"03c08a1eaab5f2458c6086ce8156e5ca","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/380705fa71bd472ba8c3ba8bb335b21a-1787861069-1787861089-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/8e0bd3126d1e48b0bafcc025ecb16486-1787861068-1787861068-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/32750804fb074661b21ef4a0c3cc20af-1787861067-1787861067-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/78582a177e2d46719ec0ada51b2df94d-1787861066-1787861066-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/f8b5aef24ef3438191e12b3f1723abcd-1787861065-1787861065-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/d10eca71e37942be884b8caac95bc20b-1787861064-1787861064-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/1b4c47ae1b5842728b798fafa55b